sequenceDiagram
    participant JS as Main JS DOM
    participant W as Rust/WASM worker
    participant H as Native web host
    participant R as Agent Runner
    participant P as PostgreSQL
    JS->>W: Request Delete chat
    W-->>JS: Named confirmation
    Note over JS,W: No HTTP before confirmation
    JS->>W: Confirm current chat
    W->>H: Typed delete effect
    Note over H: Session + origin + CSRF
    H->>R: Private delete DTO
    R->>P: Lock chat; check revision
    Note over R,P: Missing / stale stops removal
    R->>P: Remove + tombstone
    P->>P: Scrub linked content
    P-->>R: Commit new revision
    R-->>H: Correlated result
    H-->>W: Checked response
    W-->>JS: Remove chat and draft
    Note over R,P: Tombstone blocks late writes
